## 1️⃣ MICRO-INTERACTIONS (Instant Impact)

### Problem
Currently: Click a button → immediate action
Techy: Click a button → tactile feedback → sound → glow → ripple

### Solution: Ripple Effect on All Buttons

```html
<!-- Add this to your CTA buttons -->
<button class="btn-ripple">
  <span class="ripple-content">Get Started</span>
  <span class="ripple"></span>
</button>

<style>
.btn-ripple {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.btn-ripple .ripple {
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  transform: scale(0);
  animation: ripple-effect 0.6s ease-out;
  pointer-events: none;
}

@keyframes ripple-effect {
  to {
    transform: scale(4);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

.btn-ripple:active .ripple {
  animation: ripple-effect 0.6s ease-out;
}
</style>

<script>
document.querySelectorAll('.btn-ripple').forEach(btn => {
  btn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
    const ripple = this.querySelector('.ripple');
    const rect = this.getBoundingClientRect();
    const size = Math.max(rect.width, rect.height);
    const x = e.clientX - rect.left - size / 2;
    const y = e.clientY - rect.top - size / 2;
    
    ripple.style.width = ripple.style.height = size + 'px';
    ripple.style.left = x + 'px';
    ripple.style.top = y + 'px';
  });
});
</script>
```

